dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-j9[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-j9/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob proves tips and stamps alias ids[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bob-alias-tips[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-alias-tips: stamp an AliasId on every forward sigil alias, add the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sigil_alias_tip reverse check that runs the whole rewrite pipeline, emit[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tip and alias JSON from capture-rewrite, and pin it with round-trip, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]negative, and CLI tests plus docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Portable tip model, policy, and ledger[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-tip-core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-tip-core: decode the new capture-rewrite fields in CaptureCore and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add the lesson map, presentation strings, the pure fade-by-fluency [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]policy, session rules, and the UserDefaults JSON ledger with weekly [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]counts, all unit-tested.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Trigger, tip lane, and the completion-list host[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-completion-tips[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bob-alias-tips, mac-tip-core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-completion-tips: record physically Shift- or Option-typed @ and # [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sigils, run the non-blocking alias-tip lane, admit tips only in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]list's first frame, count adoption and escapes, add the Settings toggle [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and reset, pin the shared tip row in CompletionList, and add the Typing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tips docs page.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The picker host for the remaining lessons[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-picker-tips[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac-completion-tips[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-picker-tips: widen the trigger to ^ : + ~ & *, admit tips in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]picker's first frame in the chosen slot, add accessibility, escapes, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests, and docs, apply the accepted memory decisions, and propose the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]three-week stop-rule review.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-j9","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-j9.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-b87f0536d7fec0387b2dc3f6b57d09c1","started_at":"2026-11-09T17:19:43.476499+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"cf99eaa84adf722c69004beb7be882f116734d472da686d00ed98872adf43f3f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-j9.2--plan/chat.md","size_bytes":5884},"commits":{"digest":"e8e08090b2b71d277fb9e54bb51ffb78070a51a4b3b08c201328b974767f11aa","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-j9.2--plan/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-j9.2--plan/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"343d3d8fef4651454e7ff3c9b89b35dba7f1dc73450302dcab1330e37c3e14cc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-j9.2--plan/meta.json","size_bytes":792},"prompt":{"digest":"26ebadc2fa34e70d3e1d40fb6cd8e2df2001eccd6658068